{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28578","headline":"和宣州沈大夫登北楼书怀 · 杜牧","name":"和宣州沈大夫登北楼书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵符严重辞金马，星劒光芒射斗牛。\n笔落青山飘古韵，帐开红斾照高秋。\n香连日彩浮绡幕，溪逐歌声遶画楼。\n可惜登临佳丽地，羽仪须去凤池游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}